{"sha":"257a3427aa0ef8d9dd2ef5b3e2d1c021a221b116","node_id":"C_kwDOAHR-9doAKDI1N2EzNDI3YWEwZWY4ZDlkZDJlZjViM2UyZDFjMDIxYTIyMWIxMTY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Norbert Pocs","email":"norbertp@openssl.org","date":"2026-10-28T10:04:53Z"},"committer":{"name":"Eugene Syromiatnikov","email":"esyr@openssl.org","date":"2026-11-08T13:07:43Z"},"message":"Reject unsupported IV lengths for AES-GCM-SIV\n\nAES-GCM-SIV only supports a 12 byte nonce, but the IV length was not\namong its settable parameters.  EVP_CTRL_AEAD_SET_IVLEN therefore\nreported success, while the provider ignored the value,\nand the subsequent init copied 12 bytes from the caller's IV buffer.\nA shorter IV buffer was over-read, and a longer one was silently\ntruncated.\n\nAccept the IV length parameter and fail with PROV_R_INVALID_IV_LENGTH\nunless it is 12, as ChaCha20-Poly1305 already does.\n\nFixes: CVE-2026-95692\nCo-Authored-by: Billy Bob Brumley <bbb.iki.fi>\nSigned-off-by: Norbert Pocs <norbertp@openssl.org>\nReviewed-by: Eugene Syromiatnikov <esyr@openssl.org>\nReviewed-by: Andrew Dinh <andrewd@openssl.org>\nMerge-date: Sun Nov  8 12:50:49 2026\nMerged-from: https://github.com/openssl/openssl/pull/33512\n(cherry picked from commit b8997895c2e8eb0f3f39189f6c0861c1aa51c268)","tree":{"sha":"c07e465bc660f8280b19a7a31bde36b55ad1b08d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openssl/openssl/git/trees/c07e465bc660f8280b19a7a31bde36b55ad1b08d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openssl/openssl/git/commits/257a3427aa0ef8d9dd2ef5b3e2d1c021a221b116","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openssl/openssl/commits/257a3427aa0ef8d9dd2ef5b3e2d1c021a221b116","html_url":"https://github.com/openssl/openssl/commit/257a3427aa0ef8d9dd2ef5b3e2d1c021a221b116","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openssl/openssl/commits/257a3427aa0ef8d9dd2ef5b3e2d1c021a221b116/comments","author":{"login":"jogme","id":21079243,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDc5MjQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21079243?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jogme","html_url":"https://github.com/jogme","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jogme/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jogme/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jogme/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jogme/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jogme/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jogme/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jogme/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jogme/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jogme/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"esyr","id":753548,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MzU0OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/753548?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/esyr","html_url":"https://github.com/esyr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esyr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esyr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esyr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esyr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esyr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esyr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esyr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esyr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/esyr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"a0051cfe699bf5a047bc1c4faef65f80f7987366","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openssl/openssl/commits/a0051cfe699bf5a047bc1c4faef65f80f7987366","html_url":"https://github.com/openssl/openssl/commit/a0051cfe699bf5a047bc1c4faef65f80f7987366"}],"stats":{"total":14,"additions":14,"deletions":0},"files":[{"sha":"437be68f4fa6141671a960d3cbcc78d7c5a5eefb","filename":"providers/implementations/ciphers/cipher_aes_gcm_siv.c","status":"modified","additions":14,"deletions":0,"changes":14,"blob_url":"https://github.com/openssl/openssl/blob/257a3427aa0ef8d9dd2ef5b3e2d1c021a221b116/providers%2Fimplementations%2Fciphers%2Fcipher_aes_gcm_siv.c","raw_url":"https://github.com/openssl/openssl/raw/257a3427aa0ef8d9dd2ef5b3e2d1c021a221b116/providers%2Fimplementations%2Fciphers%2Fcipher_aes_gcm_siv.c","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openssl/openssl/contents/providers%2Fimplementations%2Fciphers%2Fcipher_aes_gcm_siv.c?ref=257a3427aa0ef8d9dd2ef5b3e2d1c021a221b116","patch":"@@ -265,6 +265,20 @@ static int ossl_aes_gcm_siv_set_ctx_params(void *vctx, const OSSL_PARAM params[]\n             return 0;\n         }\n     }\n+    p = OSSL_PARAM_locate_const(params, OSSL_CIPHER_PARAM_AEAD_IVLEN);\n+    if (p != NULL) {\n+        size_t iv_len;\n+\n+        if (!OSSL_PARAM_get_size_t(p, &iv_len)) {\n+            ERR_raise(ERR_LIB_PROV, PROV_R_FAILED_TO_GET_PARAMETER);\n+            return 0;\n+        }\n+        /* The nonce length can not be modified */\n+        if (iv_len != sizeof(ctx->nonce)) {\n+            ERR_raise(ERR_LIB_PROV, PROV_R_INVALID_IV_LENGTH);\n+            return 0;\n+        }\n+    }\n     return 1;\n }\n "}]}